        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Pie Five Pizza Co., Fellini's Pizza\n- Products: handcrafted personal pizza, Atlanta style pizza\n- Places: Alabama, Arkansas, Florida, Georgia, Illinois, Indiana, Kansas, Maryland, Minnesota, Missouri, Nebraska, North Carolina, Oklahoma, Tennessee, Texas, Utah, Kentucky, Virginia, Washington, D.C.\n\nFacts:\n- Pie Five Pizza Co. is a fast casual restaurant chain that specializes in handcrafted personal pizza made in less than 5 minutes.\n- As of December 2016, Pie Five Pizza Co. had 98 restaurants in Alabama, Arkansas, Florida, Georgia, Illinois, Indiana, Kansas, Maryland, Minnesota, Missouri, Nebraska, North Carolina, Oklahoma, Tennessee, Texas, Utah, Kentucky, Virginia, and Washington, D.C.\n- As of December 2016, Pie Five Pizza Co. anticipated more than 400 additional company-owned and franchise units.\n- Fellini's Pizza has 7 locations.\n- Fellini's Pizza is known for its Atlanta style pizza.",
